{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>וספדה</b> — He mentioned the distinguished family of the house of David and the family of the house of Nathan. By way of prophecy he knew that this too would be known in those days. And that the house of Nathan is the brother of Solomon is unnecessary, for the house of David is an inclusive term for both. And similarly the house of Shimei is not of the Levites; or they are partly of the house of Levi, some inside and some outside, like the house of David and Judah, which are inside and outside."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:55.944438449Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}